{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018yUmxneEHQrmNhuywfNhuq","type":"tool_result","content":"./README.md\n./launchctl-print.txt\n./bin/nightly-review.zsh\n./bin/notify.sh\n./Library/Logs/nightly-review.out\n./Library/Logs/nightly-review.err\n./Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist\n\n=== ./README.md\n# nightly-review (snapshot of my home dir, the relevant bits)\n\nA launchd user agent runs `bin/nightly-review.zsh` every night at 02:30. The\nscript asks a headless coding agent to review yesterday's commits in\n~/projects/shop and sends me the summary (or a failure note) over Telegram\nvia `bin/notify.sh`.\n\nLayout, relative to my home:\n\n- `Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist` — loaded with\n  `launchctl bootstrap gui/$UID ...` on 2026-10-12\n- `bin/nightly-review.zsh` — the job\n- `bin/notify.sh` — Telegram notifier (works when run by hand)\n- `Library/Logs/` — where the plist points stdout/stderr\n- `launchctl-print.txt` — output of `launchctl print gui/501/com.vk.nightly-review`, captured 2026-10-18 09:10\n\nI have received nothing on Telegram since it was loaded: no summaries, no\nfailure notes.\n=== ./launchctl-print.txt\ngui/501/com.vk.nightly-review = {\n\tactive count = 0\n\tpath = /Users/vk/Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist\n\ttype = LaunchAgent\n\tstate = waiting\n\n\tprogram = /bin/zsh\n\targuments = {\n\t\t/bin/zsh\n\t\t/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh\n\t}\n\n\tstdout path = /Users/vk/Library/Logs/nightly-review.out\n\tstderr path = /Users/vk/Library/Logs/nightly-review.err\n\tdefault environment = {\n\t\tPATH => /usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin\n\t}\n\n\tenvironment = {\n\t\tPATH => /opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin\n\t\tXPC_SERVICE_NAME => com.vk.nightly-review\n\t}\n\n\tdomain = gui/501 [100005]\n\tminimum runtime = 10\n\texit timeout = 5\n\truns = 6\n\tlast exit code = 1\n\n\tevent triggers = {\n\t\tcom.vk.nightly-review.StartCalendarInterval => {\n\t\t\tkeep alive = 0\n\t\t\tservice = com.vk.nightly-review\n\t\t\tname = com.vk.nightly-review.StartCalendarInterval\n\t\t\tdescriptor = {\n\t\t\t\t\"Hour\" => 2\n\t\t\t\t\"Minute\" => 30\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tspawn type = daemon (3)\n\tproperties = {\n\t\tpartial import = 0\n\t\tlaunchd bundle = 0\n\t\ttrusted = 0\n\t\ton demand = 1\n\t}\n}\n=== ./bin/nightly-review.zsh\n#!/bin/zsh\n# Nightly review of yesterday's commits, summary to Telegram.\nset -u\n\nREPO=\"$HOME/projects/shop\"\nOUT=\"$HOME/Library/Logs/nightly-review-$(date +%F).md\"\nNOTIFY=\"$HOME/bin/notify.sh\"\n\nSINCE=$(date -v-1d +%F)\nPROMPT=\"Review the commits in this repository since $SINCE.\nFor each commit: one line on what it changes and whether anything looks risky\n(migrations, auth, payments, deleted tests).\nEnd with a three-line summary I can read on my phone.\nDo not modify any file.\"\n\ncd \"$REPO\" || { \"$NOTIFY\" \"nightly review: repo missing\"; exit 1; }\n\nclaude -p \"$PROMPT\" --output-format text > \"$OUT\"\nstatus=$?\n\nif [ $status -ne 0 ]; then\n  \"$NOTIFY\" \"nightly review FAILED (exit $status), see $OUT\"\n  exit $status\nfi\n\n\"$NOTIFY\" \"nightly review done: $(head -c 300 \"$OUT\")\"\n=== ./bin/notify.sh\n#!/bin/bash\n# usage: notify.sh \"message\"  — sends a Telegram message to me.\nset -eu\n: \"${TG_BOT_TOKEN:=$(security find-generic-password -s tg-bot -w)}\"\nCHAT_ID=123456789\ncurl -sS -X POST \"https://api.telegram.org/bot${TG_BOT_TOKEN}/sendMessage\" \\\n  -d chat_id=\"$CHAT_ID\" --data-urlencode text=\"$1\" > /dev/null\n=== ./Library/Logs/nightly-review.out\n=== ./Library/Logs/nightly-review.err\nNot logged in · Please run /login\n/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh:19: read-only variable: status\nNot logged in · Please run /login\n/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh:19: read-only variable: status\nNot logged in · Please run /login\n/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh:19: read-only variable: status\nNot logged in · Please run /login\n/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh:19: read-only